                                                                                "brief":  "Open-source local-first AI novel writing app: BYOK direct AI connection, custom prompts",
                                                                                "description":  "Easy Writing (easy-writing) is an open-source (AGPL-3.0) local-first AI novel writing app.\n\nUpstream features: TipTap rich-text editor with volume/chapter tree, autosave and per-chapter version history; multi-book shelf (groups, covers, TXT/JSON import-export, recycle bin); reference toolkit (outline, character relations, settings, timeline, storyline); writing statistics and灵感 notes; BYOK AI through OpenAI-compatible providers (DeepSeek, Qwen, Zhipu, OpenRouter) and local Ollama, with selection polish, streaming continuation, AI chat, one-click book workflow and cover generation; rank trackers for Fanqie/Qidian/Qimao.\n\nLazyCat edition: works out of the box in the browser with per-user isolated data; import/export integrated with LazyCat Drive (save to / open from LazyCat Drive, isolated per microserver user); rank crawling rendered by a built-in real-browser worker so Qidian/Fanqie/Qimao work in the browser; BYOK keys stay in browser local storage only.",
                                                                                "keywords":  "AI writing, novel, web novel, writing tool, word count",
